type: software
title: "Measurement Uncertainty Handbook"
abstract: >-
  A free, practical guide to method validation and measurement uncertainty for
  ISO/IEC 17025 testing laboratories, with runnable Python notebooks on
  synthetic data and calculations from the tested labqc package.
  Draft; not yet reviewed by an external practitioner.
